{"cutoff_utc":"2026-10-20T23:14:49.455205Z","editorial_request":"Chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb m\u1ed9t b\u00e0i ph\u00e2n t\u00edch ti\u1ebfp n\u1ed1i c\u00f3 \u00edch t\u1eeb UKOIL v4 \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c tracker th\u1eeba nh\u1eadn, \u0111\u1eb7t c\u1ea1nh USOIL v6 ch\u1ec9 c\u00f3 SOURCE_FACT v\u00e0 b\u00e0i d\u1ea7u tr\u01b0\u1edbc. Tr\u1ea3 l\u1eddi v\u00ec sao r\u00fat kho d\u1ea7u M\u1ef9 ch\u01b0a \u0111\u1ee7 ch\u1ee9ng minh Brent khan to\u00e0n c\u1ea7u; \u0111\u1ed1i chi\u1ebfu nh\u1eadp kh\u1ea9u, l\u1ecdc d\u1ea7u, s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, b\u1eb1ng ch\u1ee9ng \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng truy\u1ec1n v\u00e0 ph\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ec1. Ch\u1ecdn Main UKOIL v4 n\u1ebfu ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p. Ph\u00e2n bi\u1ec7t EIA tu\u1ea7n 09/10 v\u1edbi ng\u00e0y ph\u00e2n t\u00edch/b\u1ea3n wire; c\u00e1c \u0111o\u1ea1n CC_ANALYSIS v\u00e0 k\u1ecbch b\u1ea3n ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 ph\u00e2n t\u00edch c\u00f3 \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n, provenance native do producer attested kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i consumer t\u1ef1 x\u00e1c minh worker. Kh\u00f4ng gi\u00e1 hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i, d\u1ef1 b\u00e1o hay tin m\u1edbi gi\u1ea3. B\u00e0i m\u1edbi ph\u1ea3i b\u1ed5 sung c\u00e2u h\u1ecfi \u0111\u1ecba l\u00fd/th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i so v\u1edbi b\u00e0i d\u1ea7u c\u0169, kh\u00f4ng l\u1eb7p s\u1ed1 cho \u0111\u1ee7 b\u00e0i.","feed_pointer_path":"C:\\Users\\bullw\\.codex\\worktrees\\latest-report-editorial-bridge\\ContentOps\\docs\\automation\\CONTENTOPS_LATEST_REPORT_BRIDGE_V1_20261018\\goal29\\provider_resume_binding.json","output_dir":"C:\\Users\\bullw\\AppData\\Local\\CapitalChronicle\\ContentOps\\editorial-previews\\goal29-brent-transmission","owner_manual_validation":true,"published_memory_output_root":"A:/Capital Chronicle/Runtime/ContentOps/daily_app_outputs","published_memory_store":"A:/Capital Chronicle/Runtime/ContentOps/contentops_daily_app_v1.sqlite3","research_editions_root":["C:\\Users\\bullw\\.codex\\worktrees\\latest-report-editorial-bridge\\ContentOps\\docs\\automation\\CONTENTOPS_LATEST